{"id": "ba672684-7c5f-40b5-bc61-42014e168233", "slug": "fresh-harvest-delivered-daily", "title": "Fresh Harvest | Delivered Daily", "description": "Delivered Daily UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Fresh Harvest | Delivered Daily\"\ndescription: \"Delivered Daily UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#0A3824\"\n  secondary: \"#FC4C34\"\n  accent: \"#FC4C34\"\n  background: \"#0A3824\"\n  surface: \"#F4F6E3\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"DM Serif Display\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Fresh Harvest | Delivered Daily\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 2; favorites: 2; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, threejs, effect.\n## Overview\nDelivered Daily UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nFresh Harvest Fresh Harvest Est. 2026 Fresh Harvest Quality Delivered Daily Est. 2026 FreshHarvest Quality Delivered Daily • Quality Delivered Daily • Quality Delivered Daily • Quality Delivered Daily • Quality Delivere…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Fresh Harvest; FreshHarvest; Quality Delivered Daily.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #0A3824, secondary #FC4C34, accent #FC4C34, background #0A3824, surface #F4F6E3, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse DM Serif Display for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Fresh Harvest | Delivered Daily</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    colors: {\n                        cream: '#f4f6e3',\n                        forest: '#0a3824',\n                        tangerine: '#fc4c34',\n                        sunflower: '#fcd444',\n                    },\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        serif: ['\"DM Serif Display\"', 'serif'],\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Icons -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP & Three.js -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-cream text-forest font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-tangerine selection:text-white relative\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" style=\"position:fixed; top:0; left:0; width:100vw; height:100vh; z-index:-1; pointer-events:none;\"></canvas>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full flex flex-col\">\n\n        <!-- Section 1: Hero (Top Left Reference) -->\n        <section class=\"min-h-screen w-full flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden bg-cream px-4 py-24\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative\">\n\n                <h1 class=\"font-serif text-[15vw] leading-[0.85] tracking-tighter text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center mix-blend-multiply relative z-20\">\n                    <span style=\"display:inline-block; overflow:hidden; vertical-align:bottom; padding-bottom:0.1em;\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word\" style=\"display:inline-block; transform:translateY(110%);\">Fresh</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span style=\"display:inline-block; overflow:hidden; vertical-align:bottom; padding-bottom:0.1em;\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word\" style=\"display:inline-block; transform:translateY(110%);\">Harvest</span>\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Abstract overlapping element representing the fruit bag -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[40vw] h-[40vw] min-w-[300px] min-h-[300px] opacity-90 mix-blend-normal z-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(252,76,52,0.8) 0%, rgba(252,212,68,0.6) 50%, transparent 70%); border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%; animation: morph 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\">\n                    <!-- Netting overlay simulation using repeating linear gradients -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-40 mix-blend-overlay rounded-full\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #0a3824 0, #0a3824 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 20px), repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, #0a3824 0, #0a3824 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 20px);\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Section 2: Brand Grid (Top Right Reference) -->\n        <section class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 min-h-[50vh]\">\n\n            <!-- Block 1: Green -->\n            <div class=\"bg-forest text-cream p-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-6 min-h-[300px]\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-16 h-20 bg-cream rounded-t-[50%] rounded-b-md flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-forest rounded-full absolute top-3\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-serif text-4xl leading-none tracking-tight\">Fresh<br>Harvest</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Block 2: Orange -->\n            <div class=\"bg-tangerine text-cream p-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-4 min-h-[300px]\">\n                <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-start text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">\n                    <span>Est.</span>\n                    <span>2026</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative w-12 h-16 bg-cream rounded-t-[50%] rounded-b-md flex items-center justify-center mb-2\"></div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl leading-none tracking-tight\">Fresh<br>Harvest</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mt-2\">Quality Delivered Daily</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Block 3: Yellow -->\n            <div class=\"bg-sunflower text-forest p-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-4 min-h-[300px]\">\n                <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-start text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\">\n                    <span>Est.</span>\n                    <span>2026</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative w-10 h-14 bg-forest rounded-t-[50%] rounded-b-md flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"></div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-serif text-4xl leading-none tracking-tight\">FreshHarvest</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mt-2\">Quality Delivered Daily</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Block 4: Dark Green Badge -->\n            <div class=\"bg-forest text-sunflower p-12 flex items-center justify-center min-h-[300px]\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-32 h-32 rounded-full border border-sunflower flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"animation: spin 20s linear infinite;\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" class=\"absolute w-full h-full text-sunflower\" style=\"transform: rotate(-90deg);\">\n                        <path id=\"textPath\" d=\"M 50, 50 m -35, 0 a 35,35 0 1,1 70,0 a 35,35 0 1,1 -70,0\" fill=\"transparent\"></path>\n                        <text font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"Inter, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-transform=\"uppercase\" letter-spacing=\"2\">\n                            <textPath href=\"#textPath\" startOffset=\"0%\">• Quality Delivered Daily • Quality Delivered Daily</textPath>\n                        </text>\n                    </svg>\n                    <div class=\"relative w-8 h-12 bg-sunflower rounded-t-[50%] rounded-b-sm flex items-center justify-center transform -rotate-0\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Section 3: Statement (Bottom Left Reference) -->\n        <section class=\"w-full bg-forest text-cream min-h-screen flex items-center relative overflow-hidden py-24 px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-24\">\n\n            <!-- Floating Badge -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-16 left-8 md:top-24 md:left-24 w-24 h-24 rounded-full border border-sunflower text-sunflower flex items-center justify-center hidden md:flex\" style=\"animation: spin 25s linear infinite reverse;\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" class=\"absolute w-full h-full\">\n                    <path id=\"textPath2\" d=\"M 50, 50 m -35, 0 a 35,35 0 1,1 70,0 a 35,35 0 1,1 -70,0\" fill=\"transparent\"></path>\n                    <text font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"Inter, sans-serif\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-transform=\"uppercase\" letter-spacing=\"1.5\">\n                        <textPath href=\"#textPath2\" startOffset=\"0%\">• Quality Delivered Daily • Quality Delivered Daily</textPath>\n                    </text>\n                </svg>\n                <div class=\"relative w-6 h-8 bg-sunflower rounded-t-[50%] rounded-b-sm\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-serif text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-[10vw] leading-[1] tracking-tighter w-full max-w-4xl\">\n                    <span style=\"display:block; overflow:hidden; vertical-align:bottom; padding-bottom:0.1em;\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word-2\" style=\"display:inline-block; transform:translateY(110%);\">Quality</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span style=\"display:block; overflow:hidden; vertical-align:bottom; padding-bottom:0.1em;\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word-2\" style=\"display:inline-block; transform:translateY(110%);\">Delivered</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span style=\"display:block; overflow:hidden; vertical-align:bottom; padding-bottom:0.1em;\" class=\"relative\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word-2\" style=\"display:inline-block; transform:translateY(110%);\">Daily</span>\n\n                        <!-- Small orange decorative element mimicking the bird/leaf -->\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-tangerine absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 md:-right-12 md:bottom-2 text-5xl md:text-7xl\" style=\"transform: rotate(15deg);\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </span>\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Section 4: About / Container Lines & Gradients (Bottom Right Reference) -->\n        <section class=\"w-full bg-cream text-forest py-32 px-4 md:px-8 relative z-20\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full relative\">\n\n                <!-- Premium Border Gradient Wrapper -->\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] w-full rounded-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(10,56,36,0.2) 0%, transparent 50%, rgba(252,76,52,0.2) 100%);\">\n\n                    <!-- Inner Container with Line borders -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-cream w-full relative pt-16 pb-24 px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-24\">\n\n                        <!-- Container Vertical Lines -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-[1px] bg-forest/20\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-0 w-[1px] bg-forest/20\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-forest/20\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-forest/20\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Mini Corner Squares -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-[-3px] left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-forest bg-cream z-10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-[-3px] right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-forest bg-cream z-10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-3px] left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-forest bg-cream z-10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-3px] right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-forest bg-cream z-10\"></div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-24\">\n                            <!-- Left Col: Title -->\n                            <div class=\"lg:col-span-5\">\n                                <h3 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight sticky top-32\">FreshHarvest</h3>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Right Col: Copy -->\n                            <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-8 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed font-medium text-forest/90\">\n                                <p>\n                                    FreshHarvest was created to make fresh, healthy food easier to access in everyday life. In busy cities where time is limited and market trips can be stressful, we provide a simple and reliable way for people to get the groceries they need without the hassle. By bringing together fresh farm produce, everyday essentials, and dependable delivery, FreshHarvest helps individuals and families enjoy the convenience of having quality groceries delivered straight to their door.\n                                </p>\n                                <p>\n                                    Our mission is to make healthy living more convenient by connecting customers with fresh fruits, vegetables, and trusted grocery products. We work closely with reliable farmers and suppliers to ensure that every item meets high standards of freshness and quality.\n                                </p>\n                                <p>\n                                    At the heart of FreshHarvest is a promise: every order should feel easy, dependable, and worth trusting. From the moment you place an order to the moment it arrives at your doorstep, our goal is to make grocery shopping simpler while delivering the freshness people expect every day.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Essential inline animations that are cleaner as CSS keyframes */\n        @keyframes morph {\n            0% { border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%; }\n            100% { border-radius: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%; }\n        }\n        @keyframes spin {\n            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Hero Reveal\n        gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 1.2,\n            stagger: 0.2,\n            ease: \"power4.out\",\n            delay: 0.2\n        });\n\n        // Statement Reveal on Scroll\n        gsap.to(\".reveal-word-2\", {\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: \".reveal-word-2\",\n                start: \"top 80%\",\n            },\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 1.2,\n            stagger: 0.15,\n            ease: \"power4.out\"\n        });\n\n        // --- Three.js WebGL 2D Lines Background ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        // Use a faint green color for the scene background to blend with cream slightly\n        scene.background = new THREE.Color('#f4f6e3');\n\n        const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera( window.innerWidth / - 2, window.innerWidth / 2, window.innerHeight / 2, window.innerHeight / - 2, 1, 1000 );\n        camera.position.z = 10;\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, antialias: true, alpha: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n        const lines = [];\n        const material = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n            color: 0x0a3824,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.05\n        });\n\n        // Create horizontal and vertical moving lines\n        function createLine(isHorizontal, pos) {\n            const points = [];\n            const extent = Math.max(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) * 2;\n\n            if (isHorizontal) {\n                points.push(new THREE.Vector3(-extent, pos, 0));\n                points.push(new THREE.Vector3(extent, pos, 0));\n            } else {\n                points.push(new THREE.Vector3(pos, -extent, 0));\n                points.push(new THREE.Vector3(pos, extent, 0));\n            }\n\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(points);\n            const line = new THREE.Line(geometry, material);\n            line.userData = {\n                speed: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5,\n                isHorizontal: isHorizontal,\n                initialPos: pos\n            };\n            scene.add(line);\n            lines.push(line);\n        }\n\n        // Initialize lines\n        const numLines = 20;\n        for(let i=0; i<numLines; i++) {\n            createLine(true, (Math.random() - 0.5) * window.innerHeight * 2);\n            createLine(false, (Math.random() - 0.5) * window.innerWidth * 2);\n        }\n\n        // Animation Loop\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            lines.forEach(line => {\n                if (line.userData.isHorizontal) {\n                    line.position.y += line.userData.speed;\n                    if (Math.abs(line.position.y) > window.innerHeight) line.position.y = -Math.sign(line.userData.speed) * window.innerHeight;\n                } else {\n                    line.position.x += line.userData.speed;\n                    if (Math.abs(line.position.x) > window.innerWidth) line.position.x = -Math.sign(line.userData.speed) * window.innerWidth;\n                }\n            });\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n        animate();\n\n        // Handle Resize\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.left = window.innerWidth / - 2;\n            camera.right = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            camera.top = window.innerHeight / 2;\n            camera.bottom = window.innerHeight / - 2;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "fresh-harvest-delivered-daily.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/fresh-harvest-delivered-daily.jpg", "source_name": "fresh-harvest-delivered-daily-DESIGN.md", "views": 88, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T13:30:37.52864+00:00"}